y improve your odds in future runs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/c32c49b1fd8ca941d4bc14c63e7ce2b1.avif?t=1771743025\" width=494 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f2ad53828af769690c856fa4f2f22d52.poster.avif?t=1771743025\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f2ad53828af769690c856fa4f2f22d52.webm?t=1771743025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f2ad53828af769690c856fa4f2f22d52.mp4?t=1771743025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time before the wave begins is critical. Use it to loot abandoned rooms, uncover powerful new weapons, and find blueprints for advanced defenses. Drones can be assigned to help you explore or guard key areas, letting you adapt your plan on the fly based on what you find and what is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/e9d73fadfa43ed5319cda72646a3488e.avif?t=1771743025\" width=506 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f8ac3ee2ed186c419a25ac9f55663fe4.poster.avif?t=1771743025\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f8ac3ee2ed186c419a25ac9f55663fe4.webm?t=1771743025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src