atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/f306c4eec19c914ecf52af46450aad24.avif?t=1771743025\" width=414 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/extras/fb0c0cd39eb1a4dbba0b74c8bbf5d248.avif?t=1771743025\" width=616 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful run brings you closer to uncovering new parts of the world map. Explore distinct biomes, each with their own enemy types, environmental hazards, and loot opportunities. Whether it's a scorched outback, frozen wasteland, or twisted city ruin, every zone offers new challenges and strategic choices. As you unlock new regions, you will also encounter tougher enemy waves and better gear, encouraging long-term progression and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2590\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591\u258c</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT MAKES OBLITERATOR-X UNIQUE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Obliterator-X goes beyond the basics of tower defense by combining fast-paced action, meaningful roguelike progression, and deep strategic flexibility. Whether you are scavenging for blueprints or micro-managing your drones mid-wave, every run feels fresh and full of decision-making.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 A flexible skill tree across four distinct branches: Combat, Defense, Science, and Resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Unlockable and upgradeable HQ buildings that permanently expand your options and gameplay layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Assignable drone units that respond to real-time commands and adapt to your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 A run-based structure where every failure makes your next attempt stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b A huge arsenal of traps, turrets, and weapons to discover and experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A scavenging system that makes every map feel like a risk-reward puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Bloody, chaotic enemy waves mixed with goofy charm and dark humor</p></li></ul>","developers":["Webbysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271720/04cb5e8fbcb5730ec0c4bd8f855f09b7ec282ec4/header.jpg?t=1771743025","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> All Specs still TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3271720/1818852459/1c99a1240bf86c0c779d7da56b68680136465d22/1770118020/dash_av